---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---
<section class="section shell audience" aria-labelledby="audience-title">
  <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
    <span class="eyebrow">Two ways in</span>
    <h2 id="audience-title">Engineered to use.<br /><span class="serif gradient-text">Open to inspect.</span></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="audience__grid">
    <article class="card audience__card" data-reveal>
      <span class="audience__label mono">For engineers</span>
      <h3>Keep a changing graph current.</h3>
      <p>Integrate a small typed API, serialize one state owner, and inspect the result after every accepted update.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={`${base}/get-started/`}>Start building →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="card audience__card" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 120ms">
      <span class="audience__label mono">For researchers</span>
      <h3>Trace the theorem to the code.</h3>
      <p>Compare the paper’s subgraph system, recursive levels, invariants, and the exact boundary of what is not yet claimed.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={`${base}/research/`}>Explore research →</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .audience__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .audience__card { padding: clamp(26px, 4vw, 44px); background: var(--surface); }
  .audience__label { color: var(--cobalt); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .audience h3 { margin: 22px 0 10px; font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px); letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .audience p { max-width: 420px; margin: 0 0 24px; color: var(--ink-dim); line-height: 1.68; }
  .text-link { color: var(--cobalt); font-weight: 650; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) { .audience__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
